    "created_at": "2025-07-22T16:24:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-07-22T16:24:28Z",
    "body": "I like this change from implementation pov, but I'm wondering if it could be confusing to the developers if they expect a node's customElementRegistry to be immutable in all scenarios.\n\nAre we expecting other scenarios where custom element registry can be changed? Or this will be the only exception for now?",
