    "created_at": "2025-07-22T16:26:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-07-22T16:26:50Z",
    "body": "The only special case would be global registries. And note that they are already like that. By throwing an exception now we can perhaps change it at some point that if you explicitly use a global registry it can be reused, but I'm not sure if that would really be an improvement.",
